  "description": "Offer-admission vectors. Run admit(manifest) -- the check a device performs on plugin.offer, BEFORE sending plugin.fetch and before any payload chunk moves. An 'admit' case must pass; a 'refuse' case must refuse with the given code and no fetch may be sent. Admission neither sees nor needs the payload, which is exactly what distinguishes it from the verify gate.",
  "v": 1
}
